   "content": "<div class=\"announcement\">\n<p><img src=\"https://webusstatic.yo-star.com/web-cms-test/upload/content/2026/06/26/94G7QrT1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></p>\n<p>尊敬的魔王大人，<br>欢迎归来！</p>\n<p>在那遥远的荒漠小镇之中，&ldquo;黑暗之力&rdquo;正在悄悄酝酿&hellip;&hellip;当红日升起、黄沙退去，少女和同伴迈进那阴谋笼罩的深渊洞穴，她也将迎来属于自己命运之中的高光时刻&mdash;&mdash;<br>全新五星旅人「猫眼」、五星秘纹「猫之珍藏」、赤霞全新3D战斗形象「镜中的红心皇后」即将登场。全新限时活动、诺瓦异闻、限时玩法等内容将在「枪林弹雨覆黄沙」限时活动版本与魔王大人相见！<br>查看长图可了解内容详情~</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://webusstatic.yo-star.com/web-cms-test/upload/content/2026/06/26/iQ8jYC4W.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://webusstatic.yo-star.com/web-cms-test/upload/content/2026/06/26/Vd-nmoMq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://webusstatic.yo-star.com/web-cms-test/upload/content/2026/06/26/XNkN_IRW.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://webusstatic.yo-star.com/web-cms-test/upload/content/2026/06/26/hLIvc-BB.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></p>\n</div>"
